# =====================================================================

  [KNCL]
      Covered by the license, including the non-commercial restriction,
      and subject to the Maintainer's Commercial Licensing Right.

  [KNCL-NONCOMMERCIAL-ONLY]
      Contributions accepted without the Commercial Licensing Right
      (Section 10.8). Distributable under KNCL like anything else, but it
      must be removed or replaced before a commercial release.

  [THIRD-PARTY]
      Governed by another license, which is named alongside the entry.
      "Third-party" on its own is not an answer to "may I use this", so
      an entry without a named license is a bug in this file.

  [EXCLUDED]
      Not covered by KNCL through this manifest.


